%% MUPP-013 Multi-kid birthday card fixes
%% The open wish list and how it is closed (R5); the other requirements are looks.
flowchart TD
    A[Card with a kid is shown] --> B[Visitor opens the wish list]
    B --> C[Wish button is swapped for Stäng, focus moves to it]
    C --> D[Deck is locked]
    D --> E{Close how?}
    E -- Stäng, sticky at the bottom R5 --> F[List closes]
    E -- Escape --> F
    F --> G[Wish button is back with the focus, deck is unlocked]
    G --> H[Visitor browses to the next card or kid]
